Okay, take two, take two.

285
00:15:02,767 --> 00:15:03,633
All right, take two, take two.

286
00:15:03,767 --> 00:15:04,967
Okay, take two!

287
00:15:05,100 --> 00:15:06,100
- Take two.
- Take two.

288
00:15:06,233 --> 00:15:07,300
Okay.

289
00:15:10,533 --> 00:15:13,467
I never thought you would
find me, my Prince.

290
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:14,733
[SOFT ROMANTIC MUSIC]

291
00:15:14,867 --> 00:15:16,767
I thought I would be alone
forever.

292
00:15:19,733 --> 00:15:21,667
Thank you for coming.

293
00:15:27,233 --> 00:15:28,767
From...

294
