Did you forget your line?

300
00:15:48,833 --> 00:15:50,733
No, no.

301
00:15:50,867 --> 00:15:52,067
What's your line again?

302
00:15:53,833 --> 00:15:54,933
What's written here?

303
00:15:57,500 --> 00:15:58,533
It's such an easy line.

304
00:15:58,667 --> 00:16:00,233
You just have to say
you love me.

305
00:16:03,100 --> 00:16:04,600
There it is.

306
00:16:04,733 --> 00:16:05,700
Oh, right.

307
00:16:08,467 --> 00:16:09,733
<i> That's your line.</i>

308
00:16:15,033 --> 00:16:16,367
Do you want to read it?

309
00:16:16,500 --> 00:16:20,733
[TENSE MUSIC]

310
