in our Section Narra group chat.

320
00:16:38,033 --> 00:16:39,067
<i> - Of course I do.
-</i> Enough, Raviel!

321
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,367
I didn't post that.

322
00:16:40,500 --> 00:16:41,933
I know nothing about it.

323
