326
00:16:47,667 --> 00:16:48,967
That I like you?

327
00:16:49,100 --> 00:16:50,867
How dare you make a fool of me,
Angel?

328
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:54,467
As if I'd ever fall for someone
like you.

329
00:16:56,700 --> 00:16:58,833
Calix, can you please calm down?

330
00:16:58,967 --> 00:17:01,033
Angel and I have been together
all day.

331
00:17:01,167 --> 00:17:02,800
