your lie detector game.

334
00:17:05,767 --> 00:17:07,600
Shut up, Zion!

335
00:17:07,733 --> 00:17:09,633
For all I know,
you're part of this too.

336
00:17:09,767 --> 00:17:11,733
Angel is really smart,
isn't she?

337
00:17:11,867 --> 00:17:14,400
I'm sure she's smart enough
to come up with all of this...

338
00:17:14,533 --> 00:17:15,767
just to humiliate me.

339
00:17:16,833 --> 00:17:18,333
You're smart too, Calix.

340
00:17:18,467 --> 00:17:20,567
You know I couldn't do something
like that.

341
00:17:20,700 --> 00:17:21,667
Wouldn't you?

342
00:17:23,167 --> 00:17:25,400
You have every reason
to do this to me, Angel.

343
00:17:27,033 --> 00:17:28,000
Stop denying it.

344
00:17:29,733 --> 00:17:31,267
Let's go, Calix.

345
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:32,667
We'll take care of Zion.

346
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:33,900
You handle Angel.

347
00:17:34,033 --> 00:17:39,667
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

348
00:17:39,800 --> 00:17:40,667
You're done for.

349
00:17:40,800 --> 00:17:43,267
- Look how angry he is.
- Angel, come on.

350
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:44,833
She really got under his skin.

351
00:17:44,967 --> 00:17:46,967
All right, boys, get Zion.

352
00:17:47,100 --> 00:17:48,600
- What are you doing?
- Hey!

353
00:17:48,767 --> 00:17:50,400
- Hey!
- Angel, come on!

354
00:17:50,533 --> 00:17:51,700
Go after them!

355
00:17:56,700 --> 00:17:57,833
My eye!

356
00:17:57,967 --> 00:17:59,667
- Chase them!
- You're dead, Zion!

357
00:17:59,800 --> 00:18:01,433
Hey! Go after them, hurry!

358
00:18:01,567 --> 00:18:04,100
[GRIPPING MUSIC]

359
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:13,433
