360
00:18:13,567 --> 00:18:16,633
You know, I've been calling
and messaging Sir Enrico

361
00:18:16,767 --> 00:18:17,733
for a while now,

362
00:18:17,867 --> 00:18:20,133
but I still can't reach him.

363
00:18:20,267 --> 00:18:22,067
His important guest
is about to arrive.

364
00:18:22,233 --> 00:18:23,333
The...

365
00:18:23,467 --> 00:18:25,800
The Japanese detective who's
searching for his daughter.

366
00:18:25,933 --> 00:18:28,367
Mr. Niro.

367
00:18:28,500 --> 00:18:30,100
I asked Sir Enrico

368
00:18:30,233 --> 00:18:32,400
if he wanted me to accompany him
on his yacht,

369
00:18:32,533 --> 00:18:35,033
but he said he wanted
to be alone.

370
00:18:35,167 --> 00:18:37,800
You know, Sir Enrico
isn't the type to forget

371
00:18:37,933 --> 00:18:40,067
