372
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:42,100
I have a bad feeling about this.

373
00:18:43,800 --> 00:18:44,600
What's going on?

374
00:18:44,733 --> 00:18:46,333
- Sir Enrico has a guest...
- Gino!

375
00:18:50,933 --> 00:18:51,767
Gino...

376
00:18:51,900 --> 00:18:53,600
Sorry. That's supposed
to be a secret.

377
00:18:53,733 --> 00:18:56,433
Gino, please take this child
to the quarters first.

378
00:19:00,033 --> 00:19:02,067
I'll still try to check
on Sir Enrico at the port.

379
00:19:03,733 --> 00:19:04,800
Okay, okay.

380
00:19:10,100 --> 00:19:13,533
I hate secrets in my house.

381
00:19:14,767 --> 00:19:19,067
And I hate it when people talk
behind my back.

382
00:19:19,900 --> 00:19:21,833
Ma'am Serina...

383
00:19:21,967 --> 00:19:23,833
I just told Gino

384
00:19:23,967 --> 00:19:27,600
