405
00:20:09,700 --> 00:20:11,900
The search and rescue operation
is also ongoing.

406
00:20:12,033 --> 00:20:13,067
Oh, my god. Oh, my god!

407
00:20:13,200 --> 00:20:14,600
No, no, no.

408
00:20:14,733 --> 00:20:17,433
Please, please do everything
you can to find him.

409
00:20:17,567 --> 00:20:18,600
Yes, Ma'am.

410
00:20:18,733 --> 00:20:19,867
Oh, my god.

411
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:20,833
- Enrico.
- Where's the water?

412
00:20:20,967 --> 00:20:22,900
- Where is the water?
- We'll be going now.

413
00:20:23,033 --> 00:20:24,733
This can't be happening.

414
00:20:24,867 --> 00:20:25,733
Ma'am.

415
00:20:25,867 --> 00:20:28,100
