416
00:20:28,233 --> 00:20:29,700
Ma'am, please
have some water.

417
00:20:29,833 --> 00:20:30,700
Ma'am. Ma'am.

418
00:20:30,833 --> 00:20:32,933
Ma'am, please calm down.

419
00:20:37,433 --> 00:20:38,800
Ma'am, I'll take care of that.

420
00:21:02,233 --> 00:21:05,200
<i>Coming this Monday
