433
00:21:41,233 --> 00:21:44,533
["YOU'RE MY FAVORITE SONG"
INSTRUMENTAL]

434
00:21:46,833 --> 00:21:48,300
Frenny!

435
00:21:48,433 --> 00:21:50,067
This is unbelievable.

436
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:52,100
What did it say?

437
00:21:52,233 --> 00:21:55,533
Your horoscope
says you'll meet a man

438
00:21:55,667 --> 00:21:57,833
