441
00:21:59,500 --> 00:22:00,633
This is so exciting.

442
00:22:00,767 --> 00:22:02,100
Frenny.

443
00:22:02,233 --> 00:22:03,767
- What?
- Enrico?

444
00:22:03,900 --> 00:22:05,067
Enrico Montaverde?

445
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:06,633
You're right.

446
00:22:06,767 --> 00:22:09,067
["YOU'RE MY FAVORITE SONG"
INSTRUMENTAL]
